*.sqlite*

# Per-tenant SQLite databases: Stancl names them `prefix + tenant key`
# (config/tenancy.php database.prefix = 'tenant', suffix = ''), i.e.
# `tenant<uuid>` with NO extension, so `*.sqlite*` above does not cover them.
# Tests\Traits\ProvisionsTenantDatabases unlinks the file on a normal teardown,
# but a fatal or an interrupted run leaves an untracked — and therefore
# committable — leftover. Anchored with a leading slash so it cannot swallow
# database/migrations/tenant/. 2026-08-05 re-gate, N4.
/tenant*
